  "rule": "the 1.5 characters calls of one addon and data group provide one career.character record under that addon's id and the data group; swaps is keyed by character, and another addon's layer with in data_group changes one swap only while a career of that group is the context (compatibility.md#an-older-addon-on-16, layers.md#where-a-layer-applies)",
